flowchart TD
  A[Open surface] --> B[Default view]
  B --> C{Content condition}
  C -->|Available| D[Review summary]
  C -->|None| E[Empty guidance]
  C -->|Unavailable| X[Error recovery]
  D --> F[Choose action]
  E --> F
  X --> B
  F --> G[Enter or adjust input]
  G --> H{Input valid}
  H -->|No| I[Inline guidance]
  I --> G
  H -->|Yes| J[Review result]
  J --> K{Confirm}
  K -->|Revise| G
  K -->|Proceed| L[Complete state]
  %% Rationale: clear orientation, validation, recovery, and reversible revision paths.